## Bank Management System – v2.0.0

This release represents the completed version of the Bank Management System developed for ENGI 9838 – Software Engineering Practice at Memorial University of Newfoundland.

### What's Included

- User registration and login
- Role-based access for Manager, Employee, and Customer users
- Customer account management
- Employee management
- Add, update, search, and delete operations
- Deposit and withdrawal functionality
- Real-time customer balance updates
- Password change and logout functionality
- MySQL database integration
- Input validation and basic SQL injection prevention
- Java Swing-based graphical user interface

### Testing

The system was tested using manual functional testing and JUnit-based testing, including:

- Valid and invalid login
- User registration
- Duplicate user IDs
- Customer and employee CRUD operations
- Deposit and withdrawal transactions
- Invalid input handling
- Password changes
- Role-based access
- SQL injection attempts
- Database updates and searches

### Technologies

Java • Java Swing • MySQL • JDBC • XAMPP • JUnit • GitHub • Jira

### Notes

This project was developed for academic and learning purposes and is not intended for use as a production banking system.
